{"seq":3,"slug":"blocking-confounding","title":"区组与混杂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs/blocking-confounding","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"区组与混杂\">区组与混杂</h1><p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 析因要 8 次试验，但一炉原料只够做 4 次——剩下 4 次必须用第二炉，而两炉原料有系统差异。如果不管不顾地把前 4 个组合放第一炉、后 4 个放第二炉，炉间差异就会和某些因素效应缠在一起，污染结论。区组与混杂设计回答的正是这个问题：当实验装不进一个均匀环境时，如何<strong>主动选择</strong>让哪个效应去承担炉间差异，从而保护我们真正关心的效应。<a href=\"../foundations/principles-randomization\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</a> 给了区组的原理，本篇把它推到设计层面，做精细的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>混杂</strong>（confounding，区组语境）：把某个效应与区组差异合用一个对比，使二者无法分开。区组设计主动选一个几乎肯定可忽略的<strong>高阶交互</strong>当「替罪羊」去混杂，从而保护主效应与低阶交互保持干净。</li>\n<li><strong>别名与混杂的异同</strong>：数学机制相同（两个效应共用一个对比、无法分开），但意图不同——<strong>别名为省运行数、混杂为隔离已知噪声（不省运行数）</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>广义交互</strong>（generalized interaction）：选用多个区组发生器时，它们的乘积（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB \\cdot AC = BC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）也会被自动混杂，必须一并核算，别误伤低阶效应。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡不完全区组设计</strong>（BIBD）：每个区组只放部分处理，但安排得使任意一对处理在同一区组共同出现的次数相等，保证两两比较精度一致。</li>\n<li><strong>裂区设计</strong>（split-plot）：把「难改因素」放在大单元上随机、「易改因素」放在小单元上随机的一种受限随机化，两层需用<strong>不同的误差项</strong>做 F 检验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括本篇：区组设计<strong>不省运行数，省的是精度</strong>——把已知噪声从误差里剥离出去，让 F 检验更灵敏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把析因装进区组-必然要混杂某个效应\">把析因装进区组：必然要混杂某个效应</h2><p>接着上面的例子：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 8 个组合要分到两个区组（两炉），每炉 4 个。两区组的差异本身是一个对比（区组效应）。问题是：这个区组对比会和哪个因素效应<strong>完全重合</strong>（混杂，confounding）？</p>\n<p>答案由我们选的分组规则决定。一个好的选择是按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号分组——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC = -</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span> 的 4 个组合进区组 1，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC = +</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 的进区组 2：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运行</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>区组</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>II</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现在区组对比（炉间差异）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 三阶交互完全重合——我们说 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 被<strong>混杂到区组上</strong>。代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 再也估不出来（它和炉差分不开）。但这正是聪明之处：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是三阶交互，按层级原理几乎肯定可忽略；我们用它当「替罪羊」吸收了炉间差异，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的主效应和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 二阶交互<strong>全部保持干净</strong>。这就是混杂设计的精髓：主动选一个不重要的高阶效应去混杂区组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混杂与别名的异同\">混杂与别名的异同</h2><p>混杂（confounding，区组语境）和 <a href=\"fractional-factorial\">部分析因</a> 里的别名（aliasing）数学机制相同——都是两个效应共用一个对比、无法分开——但意图不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>别名（部分析因）</th>\n<th>混杂（区组设计）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目的</td>\n<td>减少运行数</td>\n<td>隔离已知噪声（区组）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>牺牲的效应</td>\n<td>高阶交互彼此别名</td>\n<td>选定的高阶交互混进区组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行数</td>\n<td>减半/更少</td>\n<td>不变（全部组合都跑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声来源</td>\n<td>无特别处理</td>\n<td>被区组吸收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记住：区组设计<strong>不省运行数</strong>（8 个组合照跑），它省的是「精度」——把炉间噪声从误差里剥离出去，让 F 检验更灵敏。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/principles-randomization\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</a> 里「区组缩小残差」一脉相承。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[析因实验装不进&lt;br/&gt;单一均匀环境] --&gt; B[需分多个区组]&#10;  B --&gt; C{每区组容量&lt;br/&gt;是否够放全部处理?}&#10;  C --&gt;|够| D[完全区组&lt;br/&gt;区组内放全部处理]&#10;  C --&gt;|不够| E[需混杂某效应到区组]&#10;  E --&gt; F[选高阶交互做发生器&lt;br/&gt;如 ABC]&#10;  F --&gt; G[按其符号分组]&#10;  G --&gt; H[该交互混进区组&lt;br/&gt;主效应+二阶保持干净]&#10;  H --&gt; I{要分更多区组?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[多发生器&lt;br/&gt;注意广义交互也被混杂]&#10;  D --&gt; K[ANOVA含区组项&lt;br/&gt;残差变小]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[析因实验装不进&lt;br/&gt;单一均匀环境] --&gt; B[需分多个区组]\n  B --&gt; C{每区组容量&lt;br/&gt;是否够放全部处理?}\n  C --&gt;|够| D[完全区组&lt;br/&gt;区组内放全部处理]\n  C --&gt;|不够| E[需混杂某效应到区组]\n  E --&gt; F[选高阶交互做发生器&lt;br/&gt;如 ABC]\n  F --&gt; G[按其符号分组]\n  G --&gt; H[该交互混进区组&lt;br/&gt;主效应+二阶保持干净]\n  H --&gt; I{要分更多区组?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[多发生器&lt;br/&gt;注意广义交互也被混杂]\n  D --&gt; K[ANOVA含区组项&lt;br/&gt;残差变小]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"多区组与广义交互的陷阱\">多区组与广义交互的陷阱</h2><p>要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分成 4 个区组（每组 2 个组合），需要两个发生器，比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。但这里有个容易踩的坑：选了两个发生器，它们的<strong>广义交互</strong>（generalized interaction，两者相乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB \\cdot AC = BC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）也会被自动混杂到区组上。于是这个设计混杂了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 三个二阶交互——把全部二阶交互都搭进去了，可能得不偿失。</p>\n<p>教训：选区组发生器时，必须把它们及其广义交互一起算清楚，确保被混杂的全是你愿意放弃的高阶效应。好的多区组方案应让被混杂的效应尽量是高阶的。这与部分析因里「定义关系含生成元乘积」的结构如出一辙，体现了 DOE 代数的统一性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不完全区组设计\">不完全区组设计</h2><p>当处理数超过区组容量、又无法靠混杂高阶交互解决（比如分类因素的多水平比较），就用<strong>平衡不完全区组设计</strong>（BIBD，balanced incomplete block design）。它的思想是：每个区组只放部分处理，但精心安排使得<strong>任意一对处理在相同区组中共同出现的次数相等</strong>。这种平衡保证所有处理两两比较的精度一致，不会因为「某两个处理恰好从没在同一区组出现」而失真。BIBD 在感官评测（每个评委只能尝有限样品）、临床试验（每个中心只能上有限疗法）等场景很常用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"裂区设计-当某因素难以随机改变\">裂区设计：当某因素难以随机改变</h2><p>现实里有些因素改一次代价极大——烘箱温度、整批处理的灭菌条件。每次试验都重设它们不现实。<strong>裂区设计</strong>（split-plot）于是把因素分两层：难改的「整区因素」在大单元（whole plot）上随机，易改的「裂区因素」在大单元内的小单元上随机。这是一种受限随机化，代价是两层有不同的误差结构，分析时整区因素和裂区因素要用<strong>不同的误差项</strong>做 F 检验——用错误差项是裂区分析最常见的错误。裂区与 <a href=\"../foundations/variables-factors\">固定/随机效应</a> 的混合模型紧密相关，详细的误差分解见 <a href=\"../analysis/anova-effects\">方差分析与效应</a>。值得一提的是，定义筛选设计也有裂区版本，见 <a href=\"../analysis/optimal-designs\">最优设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>区组设计在实验装不进均匀环境时，主动选一个高阶交互混杂到区组上，吸收已知噪声、保护重要效应。</li>\n<li>混杂与别名机制相同（两效应共用对比）但意图不同：混杂为隔离噪声、不省运行数，别名为省运行数。</li>\n<li>多区组用多个发生器时，它们的广义交互也被自动混杂——必须一并核算，别误伤二阶交互。</li>\n<li>处理数超区组容量且无法靠高阶混杂时，用 BIBD 保证两两比较精度均衡。</li>\n<li>裂区设计处理「难改因素」，用受限随机化，分析时整区/裂区因素须用各自的误差项检验。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同源的别名技术与分辨度：<a href=\"fractional-factorial\">部分析因</a></li>\n<li>区组的原理来源：<a href=\"../foundations/principles-randomization\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</a></li>\n<li>含区组项与裂区误差结构的方差分析：<a href=\"../analysis/anova-effects\">方差分析与效应</a></li>\n<li>互联网实验里类似的「分层随机化」：<a href=\"../../../data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/randomization-methods\">AB 测试的随机化方法</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"区组与混杂","id":"区组与混杂"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"把析因装进区组：必然要混杂某个效应","id":"把析因装进区组-必然要混杂某个效应"},{"level":2,"text":"混杂与别名的异同","id":"混杂与别名的异同"},{"level":2,"text":"多区组与广义交互的陷阱","id":"多区组与广义交互的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"不完全区组设计","id":"不完全区组设计"},{"level":2,"text":"裂区设计：当某因素难以随机改变","id":"裂区设计-当某因素难以随机改变"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"部分析因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs/fractional-factorial"},"next":{"title":"方差分析与效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/analysis/anova-effects"}}